  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">La lluvia ha dado una tregua este jueves para la exhibici&oacute;n de vaquillas de la ganader&iacute;a Hermanos Guillam&oacute;n de Sant Joan de Mor&oacute; en el Barri de Sante Pere, en Onda, y por la noche, para embolar un toro de este corro.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_8642.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Si embargo, a la hora de cenar ha vuelto a caer una tromba de agua, que ha obligado a retirarse en el interior de las viviendas a todas las personas que ten&iacute;an ya montadas las mesas en la calle y hab&iacute;an empezado a comer. El toro cerril previsto para este jueves, de la ganader&iacute;a de La Victoria, se exhibir&aacute; y embolar&aacute; la tarde y la noche del s&aacute;bado 5 de julio.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8594.jpg\" alt=\"img_8594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8595.jpg\" alt=\"img_8595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8597.jpg\" alt=\"img_8597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8599.jpg\" alt=\"img_8599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8600.jpg\" alt=\"img_8600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8601.jpg\" alt=\"img_8601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8602.jpg\" alt=\"img_8602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8603.jpg\" alt=\"img_8603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8606.jpg\" alt=\"img_8606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8607.jpg\" alt=\"img_8607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8612.jpg\" alt=\"img_8612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8615.jpg\" alt=\"img_8615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8616.jpg\" alt=\"img_8616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8617.jpg\" alt=\"img_8617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8618.jpg\" alt=\"img_8618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousfestessantpereonda14/img_8620.jpg\" alt=\"img_8620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:a